{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fish_carried","model_identifier":"fish_carried","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## fish_carried\n\nCarried load, fish.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..0.9, y -12.5..0.5, z -2.2..3.2 (size 1.8 x 13.0 x 5.5 u = 5 x 37 x 15 cm).\nCarried trout (35 cm), held by the gill/mouth in the fist and hanging head-up below it: olive with a pink side stripe and dark speckles. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 12.5.\n"},"description":"## fish_carried\n\nCarried load, fish.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..0.9, y -12.5..0.5, z -2.2..3.2 (size 1.8 x 13.0 x 5.5 u = 5 x 37 x 15 cm).\nCarried trout (35 cm), held by the gill/mouth in the fist and hanging head-up below it: olive with a pink side stripe and dark speckles. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 12.5.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.875,-2.7,-1.5],"to":[0.875,0.5,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30,0,31.75,3.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24,0,27.0,3.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,8,1.75,11.2],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[27,0,30.0,3.2],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8,8,9.75,11.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10,8,11.75,11.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"07590e3c-30d0-52b9-97e3-d575eab1fdf4"},{"name":"body","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.8